name yardstick_301_feedback_loss_50
describe Yardstick for issue 301: clean 2 Mbps link with 50% of the feedback packets lost (seeds 2-11 in sm_compare)
# The Tester's repro.scn from #301. Seed 2 is one of the seeds on which our send
# rate stays near the 300 kbps start rate; sm_compare runs seeds 2-11 and traces
# seed 2 (kDefaultTraced). No expect lines: this measures, it doesn't judge.
duration 30s
seed 2
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
reverse at 0s delay=30ms loss=50%
